# Annex's shared component library.
#
# An app reaches it by relative path from its own ui/ directory:
#
#     import "../../../lib"
#
# which resolves to /home/root/annex/lib. That is a plain local directory
# import, so this file is not strictly required — Qt exposes the .qml files in
# a local directory as types either way. It is here because it makes the
# module's surface explicit: what is listed is what apps may rely on, and
# anything added to lib/ without a line here is an implementation detail
# rather than a promise.
#
# Style.js is deliberately absent. It is imported as a file
# (`import "../../../lib/Style.js" as Style`), not as a type, and listing a JS
# resource here would only be true if apps imported it as a singleton.

Backend 1.0 Backend.qml
